WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.500
We have been meeting for 40 hours.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:44.000
40 hours in two sessions
only interrupted by a shortened Sunday.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Then we had an agreement
on a common European cereal price. 

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:56.000
With this the European cause 
has taken a big step ahead.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:01.000
It is such a huge step
that I would argue - 

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.500
- that the united European ecomony
is now even more irrevocable.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.500
It is now a few hours later
and I am still pleased -

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:15.366
- with everyone in the Council,
in the neighboring rooms, -

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:22.500
- but also the critical observers,
the journalists.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.500
The negotiations were very difficult,
because everyone wanted the best for Europe, - 

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:35.500
- but at the same time had to get
the best result for their own country.

